<title>GREECE: GREEK SHIPPER LESVOS SAYS 96 PROFIT UP 18PCT.</title>
<headline>GREEK SHIPPER LESVOS SAYS 96 PROFIT UP 18PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek shipping firm Lesvos Maritime said in a statement its 1996 pretax profit rose 18 percent on turnover growth of 10 percent.</p>
<p>The company expects to raise its dividend per share from 60 drachmas in 1995.</p>
<p>Shares of Lesvos Maritime gained 59 drachmas to settle at 804. --Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
